Start the new-session form on Codex bypass where the deployment does.

With codex_bypass_default in GET /v1/info (patches/0017-codex-bypass-default.patch),
a Codex harness with no remembered preset starts on "Bypass approvals &
sandbox", and a remembered preset still wins. Because the server stamps
bypass on any Codex session that says nothing, picking Default, Full access
or Read only sends omnigent.codex_native.bypass_sandbox "0".
Base: omnigent v0.18.0 (a8676d23e88d), after 0024-admin-settings-nav.patch.
